From 129e4d4c57d134bca964aa7f411ce27f45aff07d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 17:19:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [PROTOTYPE] ProSE ion priors: fragment charges by
 deisotoping; optional cleavage-residue context

annotate:ion_prior_fragment_charges (1|auto): 'auto' models fragments up to
min(precursor charge - 1, 3) when spectra are not deisotoped (low-resolution
data). annotate:ion_prior_residue_context: condition the outcome on proline
C-terminal / D,E N-terminal of the cleavage, backing off to the position
context. Defaults reproduce 241f9a7.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01D1N3pC2AqJt57Q3v87bWxz
